{"key": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0_1012", "game": "bk1", "source_file": "6a872618f189b35a4039d59de4a885c3.bundle#TextData_en", "text_id": "SCR_MNA27_0_1012", "id_index": 4173, "category": "dialogue", "form": "line", "flags": [], "scene_id": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0", "batch_id": "bk1:B0298", "order": 1, "global_order": 8835, "prev_key": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0_930", "next_key": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0_1108", "en_sha1": "a91ab04d8e67bd270b4177eee9d23c264b38589e", "dedup_group": "bk1:en#4044", "dedup_size": 1, "tags": ["<w>", "<p>", "<w>"], "variant": null, "speaker": {"id": "NPC_121", "status": "confirmed_data", "source": "auto", "candidates": [], "gender_evidence": {"verdict": "m", "m": 2.1, "f": 0}, "style": ["archaic"], "script": {"status": "name_tag", "names": [{"id": "NPC_121", "en": "Old Man with a Bracelet", "calls": 1}], "no_tag_calls": 0, "dynamic_calls": 0}, "name_tag": {"id": "NPC_121", "en": "Old Man with a Bracelet"}, "basis": "табличка имени в скрипте игры (_SetNameTag)"}, "speaker_gender": "unknown", "addressee": {"id": "unknown", "status": "unknown", "candidates": []}, "addressee_gender": "unknown", "register": "unknown", "context": "", "ru": "Я случайно заблудился в этой Призрачной крепости и с тех пор не могу отсюда выбраться.<w><p>Какое счастье вас увидеть!\nТеперь я выберусь отсюда живым, да?\nЯ уже почти потерял надежду...<w>", "status": "edited", "qa_flags": [], "translator_note": "", "editor_note": "keep: «old man» в английском подтверждает пол", "history": [{"ts": "2026-10-19T15:23:21", "actor": "translator/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "translator", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_translator_152321.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T15:23:25", "actor": "qa/local", "action": "qa_pass"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T15:54:19", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_editor_155419.json", "ru_before": "Меня занесло в эту Призрачную крепость, и с тех пор я не могу отсюда выбраться.<w><p>Какое счастье вас увидеть!\nТеперь я выберусь отсюда живым, да?\nЯ уже почти потерял надежду...<w>"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T19:59:03", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_editor_195903.json"}]}
{"key": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0_1108", "game": "bk1", "source_file": "6a872618f189b35a4039d59de4a885c3.bundle#TextData_en", "text_id": "SCR_MNA27_0_1108", "id_index": 4174, "category": "dialogue", "form": "line", "flags": [], "scene_id": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0", "batch_id": "bk1:B0298", "order": 2, "global_order": 8836, "prev_key": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0_1012", "next_key": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0_1173", "en_sha1": "151d88569a2c55b5920873f3f5c4745d05cbe6cf", "dedup_group": "bk1:en#4045", "dedup_size": 1, "tags": ["<w>", "<p>", "<w>"], "variant": null, "speaker": {"id": "NPC_170", "status": "confirmed_data", "source": "auto", "candidates": [], "gender_evidence": {"verdict": "m", "m": 0.5, "f": 0}, "style": ["archaic"], "script": {"status": "name_tag", "names": [{"id": "NPC_170", "en": "Tumart", "calls": 1}], "no_tag_calls": 0, "dynamic_calls": 0}, "name_tag": {"id": "NPC_170", "en": "Tumart"}, "basis": "табличка имени в скрипте игры (_SetNameTag)"}, "speaker_gender": "unknown", "addressee": {"id": "unknown", "status": "unknown", "candidates": []}, "addressee_gender": "unknown", "register": "unknown", "context": "", "ru": "Интересно, как там Туфайр и Тулун. Они, наверное, так за меня тревожились.<w><p>Они всегда были так добры ко мне. Хорошо, что я смогу снова с ними увидеться.<w>", "status": "edited", "qa_flags": [], "translator_note": "new_term: Tufayr → Туфайр; new_term: Tulun → Тулун", "editor_note": "", "history": [{"ts": "2026-10-19T15:23:21", "actor": "translator/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "translator", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_translator_152321.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T15:23:25", "actor": "qa/local", "action": "qa_pass"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T15:54:19", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_editor_155419.json"}]}
{"key": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0_1173", "game": "bk1", "source_file": "6a872618f189b35a4039d59de4a885c3.bundle#TextData_en", "text_id": "SCR_MNA27_0_1173", "id_index": 4175, "category": "dialogue", "form": "line", "flags": [], "scene_id": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0", "batch_id": "bk1:B0298", "order": 3, "global_order": 8837, "prev_key": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_0_1108", "next_key": null, "en_sha1": "8098305351cd0360fa69eca63652bf9a08467db6", "dedup_group": "bk1:en#4046", "dedup_size": 1, "tags": ["<w>", "<p>", "<w>"], "variant": null, "speaker": {"id": "NPC_170", "status": "confirmed_data", "source": "auto", "candidates": [], "gender_evidence": {"verdict": "m", "m": 1.2, "f": 0}, "style": [], "script": {"status": "name_tag", "names": [{"id": "NPC_170", "en": "Tumart", "calls": 2}], "no_tag_calls": 0, "dynamic_calls": 0}, "name_tag": {"id": "NPC_170", "en": "Tumart"}, "basis": "табличка имени в скрипте игры (_SetNameTag)"}, "speaker_gender": "unknown", "addressee": {"id": "unknown", "status": "unknown", "candidates": []}, "addressee_gender": "unknown", "register": "unknown", "context": "", "ru": "Какая судьба...\nЧеловек, который искал свою семью, спас мне жизнь.<w><p>В моём возрасте мне и в голову не приходило, что я почувствую такую благодарность к собственному отцу, Кузману. Я приду.<w>", "status": "edited", "qa_flags": [], "translator_note": "", "editor_note": "keep: род в глаголе — у названного субъекта", "history": [{"ts": "2026-10-19T15:23:21", "actor": "translator/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "translator", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_translator_152321.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T15:23:25", "actor": "qa/local", "action": "qa_pass"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T15:54:19", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_editor_155419.json", "ru_before": "Какая судьба...\nЧеловек, который искал свою семью, спас мне жизнь.<w><p>В моём возрасте мне и в голову не приходило, что я буду так благодарен собственному отцу, Кузману. Я приду.<w>"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T19:59:03", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_editor_195903.json"}]}
{"key": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_1_1275", "game": "bk1", "source_file": "6a872618f189b35a4039d59de4a885c3.bundle#TextData_en", "text_id": "SCR_MNA27_1_1275", "id_index": 4176, "category": "dialogue", "form": "line", "flags": [], "scene_id": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_1", "batch_id": "bk1:B0298", "order": 0, "global_order": 8838, "prev_key": null, "next_key": null, "en_sha1": "873bec2bfb2b0b62fdc29d3919c60b61fd34d25c", "dedup_group": "bk1:en#4047", "dedup_size": 1, "tags": ["<w>", "<p>", "<w>", "<p>", "<w>"], "variant": null, "speaker": {"id": "NPC_121", "status": "confirmed_data", "source": "auto", "candidates": [], "gender_evidence": {"verdict": "m", "m": 0.65, "f": 0}, "style": ["archaic"], "script": {"status": "name_tag", "names": [{"id": "NPC_121", "en": "Old Man with a Bracelet", "calls": 1}], "no_tag_calls": 0, "dynamic_calls": 0}, "name_tag": {"id": "NPC_121", "en": "Old Man with a Bracelet"}, "basis": "табличка имени в скрипте игры (_SetNameTag)"}, "speaker_gender": "unknown", "addressee": {"id": "unknown", "status": "unknown", "candidates": []}, "addressee_gender": "unknown", "register": "unknown", "context": "", "ru": "Значит, вы проделали такой путь, чтобы разыскать меня по просьбе Кузмана?<w><p>Какая ирония!\nТот, кто спас мне жизнь, принёс весть о тяжёлом состоянии моего отца...<w><p>Видно, всё это устроили боги. Я с радостью пойду. Здесь нужно расписаться, да?<w>", "status": "edited", "qa_flags": [], "translator_note": "", "editor_note": "keep: «old man» в английском подтверждает пол", "history": [{"ts": "2026-10-19T15:23:21", "actor": "translator/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "translator", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_translator_152321.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T15:23:25", "actor": "qa/local", "action": "qa_pass"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T15:54:19", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_editor_155419.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T19:59:03", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_editor_195903.json"}]}
{"key": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_2_1441", "game": "bk1", "source_file": "6a872618f189b35a4039d59de4a885c3.bundle#TextData_en", "text_id": "SCR_MNA27_2_1441", "id_index": 4177, "category": "dialogue", "form": "line", "flags": [], "scene_id": "bk1:SCR_MNA27_2", "batch_id": "bk1:B0298", "order": 0, "global_order": 8839, "prev_key": null, "next_key": null, "en_sha1": "bac7895498b96b5a7dc33d35135d5a3fb1f2c1ac", "dedup_group": "bk1:en#4048", "dedup_size": 1, "tags": ["<w>"], "variant": null, "speaker": {"id": "NPC_121", "status": "confirmed_data", "source": "auto", "candidates": [], "gender_evidence": {"verdict": "none", "m": 0.0, "f": 0.0}, "style": ["archaic"], "script": {"status": "name_tag", "names": [{"id": "NPC_121", "en": "Old Man with a Bracelet", "calls": 1}], "no_tag_calls": 0, "dynamic_calls": 0}, "name_tag": {"id": "NPC_121", "en": "Old Man with a Bracelet"}, "basis": "табличка имени в скрипте игры (_SetNameTag)"}, "speaker_gender": "unknown", "addressee": {"id": "unknown", "status": "unknown", "candidates": []}, "addressee_gender": "unknown", "register": "unknown", "context": "", "ru": "Эй! Куда вы?!\nСкажите, кто вы и зачем сюда пришли.<w>", "status": "edited", "qa_flags": [], "translator_note": "", "editor_note": "", "history": [{"ts": "2026-10-19T15:23:21", "actor": "translator/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "translator", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_translator_152321.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T15:23:25", "actor": "qa/local", "action": "qa_pass"}, {"ts": "2026-10-19T15:54:19", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261019/bk1_B0298_editor_155419.json"}]}
